Refining of Mineral Oil and Gas, BREF REF (@ic-refinery: 0, is #reference, #part-of @ic-sources) { r_3ZQ3XT8F2XTED0CF8KN79K9NP6
European Commission, Joint Research Centre. Refining of Mineral Oil and Gas, BREF REF. published February 2015; BAT conclusions October 2014. [Official reference and full-text access](https://bureau-industrial-transformation.jrc.ec.europa.eu/reference/refining-mineral-oil-and-gas-0).

This technical reference covers refineries and natural-gas plants, chemical and physical conversion families, energy and hydrogen networks, product treatment and residual systems. Exploration, extraction, marketing and other activities lie outside its defined coverage.

Read the complete refining/conversion, hydrogen/sulfur, utility and environmental chapters for the chosen integrated case. Compare whole feed/product and hydrogen/energy accounts, preserving the particular crude/feed assay, boundaries and time. The whole reference supports advanced route comparison without supplying every upstream or downstream industry.

Identity, stated scope, date and official access were checked on 29 October 2026. This is a dated technical reference, not a claim that every described plant, technology or legal reference is current everywhere. Preserve its attribution, actual reuse notice and third-party exceptions; public access is not described as a blanket CC licence. Full-text or automated inspection limits are distinguished where relevant. No book, figure, industrial data or associated media is bundled.

